# Project Rules

The canonical, tool-agnostic agent guide for this repo lives in **`AGENTS.md`**
at the repo root, with nested `backend/AGENTS.md`, `src/AGENTS.md`, and
`mcp_app/AGENTS.md` for area-specific detail. **Read the nearest `AGENTS.md`
before working**, plus `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` before backend changes.

Quick reminders (see `AGENTS.md` for the full context):

- Use the logging library, not `print`.
- Don't hardcode the app/brand name — use `settings.BRAND_*` (defaults in
  `backend/app/core/default_config.py`); admins override under Admin -> Settings.
- Scratch scripts run inside `backend/venv`; most libs aren't globally installed.
- Local DB is SQLite at `backend/app_hub.db`; you may query it directly.
- Tail `backend.log` / `frontend.log` for errors, and always check `backend.log`
  before finishing a change that reloads FastAPI.
- `./dev.sh --debug` enables debugpy — attach via the "Attach to Backend" config
  rather than scattering debug statements.
